          "expr": "((sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count{service=\"shipping-service\",status=~\"[45].*\"}[1m])) or vector(0)) / (sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count{service=\"shipping-service\"}[1m])) > 0)) * 100 or vector(0)",
